<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 595.45, down 0.79.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 310 to 224.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,608,520 compared with 20,341,560 on Monday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
